          "from": "/i/ in getih 'blood'",
          "to": "Central Javanese [g̊ət̪ɪh]",
          "note": "Western (Banyumasan) Javanese keeps [i] in this position ([g̊ət̪ih]) and Eastern Javanese has [ɛ] ([g̊ət̪ɛh])."
        }
